<title>BELGIUM: EU clears GKN/Brambles waste management deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears GKN/Brambles waste management deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared a deal under which GKN Plc and Brambles Industries Ltd acquire joint control of waste management services company Mabeg Holdings Gesellschaft fuer Entsorgungswirtschaft mbH und Co KG.</p>
<p>&quot;In assessing the operation, the commission found that there was no geographic overlap in the non-hazardous waste-management market and that any potential overlap in the hazardous waste-management market wass not substantial,&quot; the Commission said in a statement explaining its decision.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
